# ASMS JSON API - manual smoke requests (VS Code REST Client / Rider / VS .http)
# 1) run "login" requests, copy tokens into the variables below.
@base = http://localhost:5090
@customerToken = PASTE
@technicianToken = PASTE
@adminToken = PASTE
@requestId = 1
@billId = 1
@techProfileId = 1

### Auth - login (repeat per role)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@serviceapp.com", "password": "Admin@1234" }

### Auth - wrong password -> 401
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@serviceapp.com", "password": "nope" }

### Customer - dashboard
GET {{base}}/api/customer/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Customer - categories
GET {{base}}/api/customer/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Customer - create request
POST {{base}}/api/customer/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category": "Plumbing", "description": "Kitchen sink leaking under the cabinet", "scheduledDate": "2026-12-01T10:00:00", "address": "12 QA Street", "pinCode": "680001" }

### Customer - past date (expected 400; baseline returns 200 = BUG-10)
POST {{base}}/api/customer/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category": "Plumbing", "description": "past date", "scheduledDate": "2020-01-01T10:00:00", "address": "past st", "pinCode": "680001" }

### Customer - list / detail / cancel / rate
GET {{base}}/api/customer/requests?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/customer/requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/customer/requests/{{requestId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/customer/requests/{{requestId}}/rate
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stars": 4, "comment": "good" }

### Customer - pay bill (baseline: completes WITHOUT any gateway payment = BUG-02)
POST {{base}}/api/customer/bills/{{billId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Technician - dashboard / toggle / jobs
GET {{base}}/api/technician/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/technician/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/technician/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/technician/jobs/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/technician/jobs/{{requestId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}

### (baseline: no-op stub, always 200 = BUG-07)
POST {{base}}/api/technician/jobs/{{requestId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/technician/jobs/{{requestId}}/bill
Authorization: Bearer {{technicianToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "laborCost": 500, "materialCost": 250.55, "description": "PVC pipe" }

### Admin
GET {{base}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/admin/requests?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/admin/requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/admin/technicians/available?category=Plumbing
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/admin/requests/{{requestId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "technicianProfileId": {{techProfileId}} }

###
GET {{base}}/api/admin/users?role=Technician
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### SignalR negotiate with JWT (baseline: 302 to login = BUG-19)
POST {{base}}/hubs/service/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
